WEBVTT

00:23:57.410 --> 00:24:00.371
the more creative they became
over their careers,

00:24:00.395 --> 00:24:03.656
but it wasn't traveling
or even living abroad that mattered.

00:24:03.680 --> 00:24:06.617
It was the amount of time
they spent working abroad.

00:24:06.641 --> 00:24:08.953
They couldn't just observe it
from the sidelines.

00:24:08.977 --> 00:24:10.720
They had to be in the arena.

00:24:10.744 --> 00:24:14.940
That's how they really internalize
the novel elements of a foreign culture.

00:24:14.964 --> 00:24:18.698
For Lyn, seeking out new perspectives
included small steps, too.

00:24:18.722 --> 00:24:22.300
LS: I do things that I don't normally do.

00:24:23.043 --> 00:24:25.690
And so that could be very simple things,

00:24:25.714 --> 00:24:29.635
like taking a different route to work.

00:24:29.659 --> 00:24:35.880
It's really, put yourself
into different experiences